---
import { why, links } from '../data/campaign';
---
<section id="why" class="why surface-light" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="wrap why__layout">
    <figure class="documentary">
      <img src="/images/between-runs.png" width="3354" height="1902"
           alt="Lachlan sitting beside the camper with his running shoes off."
           loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      <figcaption>A moment off my feet.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="why__copy">
      <h2 id="why-title" class="editorial-title">Why I'm running home.</h2>
      <p class="why__opening">{why.opening} <strong>{why.question}</strong></p>
      <p>I grew up in Toowoomba. Brisbane has been home since 2014. It's where my wife and our young family are, and where I've built my business.</p>
      <p>{why.body[1]}</p>
      <p>I don't have it all worked out. What I've learned is to show up, stack small wins and lean on the people around me when it gets difficult.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={links.lachlanStuart}>More about my story <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .why { padding-block: var(--editorial-space) 2rem; }
  .why__layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, .8fr); gap: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); align-items: center; }
  .why h2 { margin-bottom: 1.75rem; }
  .why__copy p { color: var(--on-light-2); }
  .why__opening { font-size: 1.125rem; }
  .why__opening strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(--near); }
  .why .text-link { margin-top: .75rem; }
  @media (max-width: 56.25rem) {
    .why__layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .why__copy { max-width: 42rem; }
  }
</style>
